Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.09,0:00:07.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　源源不绝的热情{\fad(500,00)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:13.06,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着怦然心动的未来  伸出双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:19.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够放出光芒　IT'S WONDERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来那无法预测的黑夜  震撼着你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:32.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法相信任何东西  你充耳不闻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:40.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你相遇的瞬间  我找到了真正的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:49.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自觉的温柔呈现在面前  把我们唤醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:56.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　不会再迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:01:06.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要构筑起跟你在一起的未来  就能飞向任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:11.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,CHANGE MY MIND　源源不绝的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:16.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着未知的明天  张开双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:23.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够展翅飞翔　IT'S WONDERLAND{\fad(0000,480)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 日暮家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 戈薇的爷爷 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是由加啊 嗯 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.83,0:01:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问戈薇在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇又闪到腰 正在卧床休息呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？闪到腰？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:02:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁闪到腰了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:02.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把电话给我 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请找戈薇听电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:09.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她糖尿病又犯了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？她又去住院检查了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脚气病 风湿病还有神经痛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这孙女真是多病啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 给我差不多一点啦 爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么年轻的我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:30.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要得什么风湿病神经痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想说谎啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在战国时代的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是找藉口帮你隐瞒行踪罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的话才是对的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 我今天明明就在家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  戈薇 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:51.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每到周末你不是都急急忙忙的跑到那边去的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才说你得了急病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我留在这里又有什么关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这边的世界才是我真正该待的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.84,0:03:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太 你又一大早就开始玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.18,0:03:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天气这么好 给我到外面玩去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个星期六一起去看电影好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个星期六？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我想偶尔应该从紧张的学习中解放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你另外有喜欢的人了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fs28}我都干了些什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,GAMEOVER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我可不是担心犬夜叉才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 我要去约会了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:09.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉被弹开了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:28.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉他只是嘴硬 力量还没恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这什么蛮力啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好大的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不给你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:45.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:54.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50年前的真相 奈落的正体
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被包围的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:07.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分身
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.85,0:05:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然很微弱 但我感觉到了四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人都没有嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还特地跑回来 真像个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经这么晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我快要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是平时应该可以避开的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作之所以变慢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像并不只因为伤势还没复原啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎戈薇不在的话 犬夜叉就无法发挥原来的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼野干肯定是借助了四魂之玉的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:53.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要攻击四魂碎片的所在 就能打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:07:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是戈薇 肯定能找到碎片所在的要害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:03.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再说这种丧气话了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇已经不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟她的国家连接着的枯井已经被我封死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:12.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她再也无法到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么危险的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能再让戈薇被卷进来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:37.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我回来复习考试的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总是来碍事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表情好奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:49.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对呀 我现在正在约会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种时候我怎么光想着那个白痴了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…刚才说到哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在勉强自己吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勉强…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明明满脑子都在想着那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是在说我逞强吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:09.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌啦 我才没有勉强呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…大概能理解你现在的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:18.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在意那个家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定是不顾自己身体 勉强跑出来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:27.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得日暮的爷爷说你有痛风…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…对北条同学都说这些…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪里来的什么病嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的伤会不会还没复原？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说那个了 搞不好已经死掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学 对不起 我们下次再约会吧 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然看不到…在哪里？在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被…被发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好想回去…犬夜叉没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂…碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:09:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:09:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:09:59.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于能回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:18.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对没错 戈薇来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:24.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别来…碍事！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然之间变强了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你先解决掉他再走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的伤势还没有完全复原
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.37,0:10:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方就趁这时候来攻击我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他果然遇到危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有完沒完啊你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:15.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜 你为什么回来…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:24.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:30.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你根本就不来接我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:35.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是跟你说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:41.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:43.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想…我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.98,0:12:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你那表情什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不想我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:57.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我一直担心你 像个傻瓜似的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:13:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌…你这个什么都不懂的呆子…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂…你在哭吗…戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有什么好哭的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:06.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是因为难过才哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是因为太不甘心才哭的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一见面就吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:15.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这次总算顺利渡过难关了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫大人 那是戈薇小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 你不觉得很奇怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一大群毒虫竟然不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:32.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.82,0:13:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗那女人在50年前就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…什么气息…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有谁在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还带着四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且有非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:35.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于让我逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:48.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…就是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:04.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我送你下地狱前先问你一句话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底对我抱有什么怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是不知道自己为什么被怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕死也不会瞑目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:21.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是阿枫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也变老了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:26.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 你就是鬼蜘蛛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这名字真叫人怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.99,0:15:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我奈落不是什么鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:45.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我确实是50年前从鬼蜘蛛身上孕育出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫鬼蜘蛛的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个顽劣的家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对那位照顾自己的心地善良的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱着非分之想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被那股强烈的邪气吸引
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:09.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多妖怪聚集过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.19,0:16:17.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我这腐朽的灵魂还是有点用的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很美味吧？很想吃吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要一个能够自由活动的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到四魂之玉 并让桔梗成为我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把身体 把力量给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 成群的妖怪结合成一体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就诞生出了我奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了创造身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:57.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要无数的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了那个巫女当时变成了一个没用的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让这片土地被妖怪所侵蚀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏她爱上了一个无聊的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为她因其幼稚的情欲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而使用了四魂之玉的力量的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 那件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是亲身经历过的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.13,0:18:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就不想做什么人类
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉我就不客气地收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是你设计的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:31.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你欺骗了我和桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我问你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们所珍惜的信赖感
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这么容易就崩溃的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强烈到想要杀死对方的那种怒气 才是真实的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才是你们去掉所有伪装的 真正的面貌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗也真是没有悟性
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她根本不必选择什么死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:19:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该乖乖被我疼爱 交出四魂之玉才对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只想让自己活得长久
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放纵自己那可悲的欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,领悟到黑暗的真理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个愚蠢的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉只有被玷污后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能显现出它的美丽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:35.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 他身上有多少碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片…10 不 20…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:41.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比那更多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就如你所愿把它玷污吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:49.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用你那肮脏的血液浸透它！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是瘴气 快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:40.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陷入我的瘴气之中了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.47,0:20:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把瘴气…切开了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.07,0:21:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他逃走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那个混蛋竟然逃走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 出来和我战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.73,0:21:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背上有蜘蛛的印记？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 根据犬夜叉的描述
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有个类似烧伤的蜘蛛疤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:22:00.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山贼鬼蜘蛛曾经受了很重的烧伤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那说不定是鬼蜘蛛的残留
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背上的蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.61,0:22:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是奈落的标志吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.71,0:22:18.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:24.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:30.10,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:37.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:47.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.62,0:22:53.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:59.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:06.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:14.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将徬徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:20.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:26.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.95,0:23:33.49,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.63,0:23:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在某个宅邸里接到了一份委托
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护卫亡魂免遭妖怪侵扰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.37,0:23:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只妖怪收集了不少亡魂并带去别处
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.67,0:24:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幕后黑手竟是背负强大怨念的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巫女?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个巫女 难道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.89,0:24:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无人能抚平的愤怒和悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟会何去何从？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪恶微笑 桔梗徘徊的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬请期待
